# Power Surge counts what was an untapped land as the turn began, whatever it is when the ability resolves. Bot1's
# Mutavault is its one land, untapped as turn 3 begins. In the upkeep, with Power Surge's ability on the stack, Bot1 taps
# Mutavault for {C} to animate it, and Bot2 flashes Swift Reconfiguration onto it: a Vehicle artifact that has lost the
# land type (CR 205.1a, 613.1d). It was an untapped land at the beginning of the turn, so Power Surge deals 1; counting the
# lands as they are now (or the untapped permanents of the beginning by what they are now) would deal 0.

